Exception: The graph files r7-12/R7_12_419.txt, r8-19/R8_19_1238.txt and triple-gluing/*.txt contain, as
parts, graphs published by other authors: the Exoo-Tatarevic (6,7)-graph on 114 vertices (complemented) and M. Tatarevic's
(7,8)-colouring on 218 vertices (github.com/milostatarevic/ramsey-numbers, no license stated there). These parts are not
covered by this license; they are included as mathematical data with their sources named in the folder READMEs. Credit the
original authors when you use them. Files from google-research are under the Apache License 2.0 (r7-16/LICENSES).

The files in r55-srg45/data (K/, B/, mckay/) are copies of or selections from the Ramsey graph lists of Brendan D. McKay
(https://users.cecs.anu.edu.au/~bdm/data/ramsey.html). They are not covered by this license; see that page for their terms
and credit B. D. McKay when you use them.
